heme":"white","button_link":"https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/collections\/replacement-parts","danwei":false,"text":"<p>In need of a new part for your Monument Grill? Search Here.<\/p>","link":""}},"item_gLCHja":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"return","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icons8-export-pdf-100.png","item_layout_position":"left","heading":"Manuals & Videos","title_color":"","button_label":"Download Documents","button_style":"btn btn--secondary","color_scheme":"white","button_link":"https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/pages\/assembly-manuals-and-videos","danwei":false,"text":"<p>Print, preview or download literature for your grill.<\/p>","link":""}},"item_R9j9DY":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"chat_bubble","custom_icon":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/icons8-warranty-100_f0d6a89c-63d1-407b-b38e-bc39304878ab.png","item_layout_position":"left","heading":"Warranty","title_color":"","button_label":"View Warranties","button_style":"btn btn--secondary","color_scheme":"white","button_link":"\/pages\/warranty","danwei":false,"text":"<p>View the warranty details for your grill. <\/p>","link":""}}},"block_order":["item_TL6Utn","item_Q7DAan","item_gLCHja","item_R9j9DY"],"settings":{"link_id":"Support","is_show_arrow":false,"item_layout_position":"left","item_bg":"","item_text_color":"","padding_top":50,"padding_bottom":50,"button_label":"Optiona button","is_click":false,"show_popup":false,"cur_liquid":"","click_id":"","is_nofollow":false,"button_link":"","button_style":"btn btn--primary","show_gird":false,"show_row":false,"mobile_show_gird":false,"heading":"","heading_title_color":"","heading_size":"h3","title_des":"","title_type_scale":"large","heading_align":"text-start","font_weight":false,"font_uppercase":false,"data_list":false,"hr_line":true,"data_color":"","number1_name":"","number1_des":"","number2_name":"","number2_des":"","show_online_display":false,"icon_size":48,"text_type_scale":"medium","icon_position":"above","mobile_stack":false,"show_all_on_mobile":true,"section_height":"medium","bg":"#f9f9f9","text_color":"","color_scheme":"1","full_width":true,"dividers":"none","prevent_animation":false}},"faq_tcPUPr":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_YcnprG":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Where can I see the temperature?","text":"<p>You can check the temperature via Bluetooth app or Smart Temperature Display.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_mqHWNF":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Can I use Denali without using Smart Systems?","text":"<p>The Denali without the smart system also has the basic functions of a grill, but you need to prepare a separate thermometer to know the internal temperature of the grill.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_UYYaqd":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How long can my battery box support me to use the electronic screen?","text":"<p>Four #5 batteries provide 80 hours of display use when only the display is powered.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_HdTpHB":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Which grills can be converted to natural gas?","text":"<p>This grill 41847NG and D605 can be converted to natural gas with the purchase of Monument Grills Conversion Kit model 98523 (Sold Separately). You can click here to buy the conversion kit.<\/p><p>The link: https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/products\/natural-gas-conversion-kit<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_PbBJKM":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What is the glass window made of?","text":"<p>Our glass window are made of high temperature resistant silicone compounds.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_JDEbNU":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How much weight can the side tables on my grill hold?","text":"<p>The shelf is designed to hold plates of food to be cooked, spices, sauces, beverages, etc. It should not be used to hold excessive weight. The Denali grill shelves can hold up to 45lbs and the rest of the grill shelves can hold up to 20lbs.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_mYRfhC":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How should I preheating?","text":"<p>Ensuring proper preheating of the grill is crucial for achieving the desired high temperature. Begin by lighting the grill following the instructions in your owner's manual. Then, turn up the burners, cover the grill with the lid, and wait approximately 15 minutes.<\/p><p>After this time, the grill should reach a temperature between 500 and 550 degrees Fahrenheit. Properly preheating your grill is also essential for preventing food from sticking to the cooking grates.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_bj67kc":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Will my tabletop gas grill have a suitable rain cover?","text":"<p>Yes, we have rain cover for portable gas grill, you need to buy them separately on the website.<\/p><p>The link: https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/products\/gas-and-charcoal-grill-cover?variant=39833209077823<\/p><p>The link: https:\/\/monumentgrills.com\/products\/gas-and-charcoal-grill-cover?variant=39833181618239<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_XKqxxp":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Does the tabletop grill come with a propane hose?","text":"<p>The grill includes a hose to connect to 20lb Propane Tank.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_bYwRzR":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What is the function of the chain hanging beside the front panel?","text":"<p>It is the manual lighting stick, our grill is equipped with a manual ignition device, which you can use to light the grill when there is a problem with the electronic ignition device.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_hwWpxE":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How do I use the side burner?","text":"<p>Before turning on the gas to \"ON,\" check the supply hose. If there are cuts, abrasions, or signs of wear, it must be replaced before use. If there is a gas smell, do not use the grill.<br\/><br\/>1. Fully open the side burner lid.<br\/>2. Push and turn the side burner knob to the max position. Simultaneously, press and hold the electronic ignition button for 3-5 seconds to ignite the burner.<br\/>3. If the side burner does not light after 5 seconds, turn the knob to OFF. Close the LP gas cylinder and wait 5 minutes for the gas to clear. Then open the lid and repeat step 2.<br\/>4. If the burner still does not ignite, refer to the section on lighting with matches.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_iPxiX4":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How do I light a burner with a match?","text":"<p>1. Take the manual lighting stick. <br\/>2. Insert a match into the lighting stick. <br\/>3. Follow steps of the Basic Lighting Procedure. <br\/>4. Light the match and extend the lighting stick to cooking grid surface. <br\/>5. Turn the desired control knob to the Max position setting to release gas. The burner should light immediately.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_T9LVCm":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What size tank should I use for my grill?","text":"<p>The standard QCC1 20 lb propane tank fits our gas grill products.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_YAkVA6":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"ls the Bluetooth stable to use?","text":"<p>Yes. The Bluetooth connect with the grill reliably for up to 65 feet outside.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_Y6AfEV":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"Why is Denali's warming rack constructed differently than regular ones?","text":"<p>Denali's warming rack is a multifunctional warming rack that can hang chicken Thights, chicken legs, roast peppers and much more, which is more versatile compared to ordinary cooking grids.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_CEJjRG":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What grill grids fit my Denali?","text":"<p>The sku for the grill grids adapted to Denali is as follows:<br\/>4B:97888\/3*A100\/A100+A104<br\/>6B:3*A101\/A101+A105<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_kygPaj":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How much charcoal can I place in my charcoal grill?","text":"<p>The weight of charcoal that can be stored in our charcoal grills during normal use is 1.2KG\/ 2.6Lbs.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_99p6QB":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What type of charcoal can I use in my grill?","text":"<p>We recommend using a standard size charcoal briquette in order to provide the most consistent heat and predictable burn time while grilling.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_XGTQPK":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"What features are included in the app?","text":"<p>Our APP contains recipes, real-time temperature view of the grill, grill probe temperature reminder, grill timer and more!<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_4DQPXc":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How do I connect my phone to the grill's Bluetooth?","text":"<p>• Scan the QR code below and download the APP (Monument Grills) ,or search \"Monument Grills\" in APP store. <br\/>• After download the APP, initiate Bluetooth function of your phone, meanwhile turn on the Digitemp Display on the grill. <br\/>• Open the APP, click orange “Add Device” button, the APP will search Monument smart Grills nearby (Step 1). <br\/>• A grill icon will be shown below “Discovering devices” after the smart grill is detected by the APP, click the orange “Add” button to the next step(step 2). <br\/>• Click the blue icon to confirm adding the grill (step 3). <br\/>• There will be a green tick above the grill to indicate the grill is adding successfully, and click Done” on the upright corner to go to next step. You can rename the grill in this page with the grey pen icon at the right side of the grill <br\/>(step 4). <br\/>• The real-time temperature is shown in this page, and you can adjust probe temperature or select the recipe you would like to use, detail in next page(step 5). <br\/>*Bluetooth range: in empty flat area without any obstacle, the bluetooth range is 115 feet. and the range will be 10 feet with a wall or other similar obstacle.However,maximum communication range will vary depending on obstacles(person, metal, wall, etc.) or electro-magnetic environment.<\/p>","read_number":0}},"question_rUrRGG":{"type":"question","settings":{"icon":"question_mark","heading":"How do I use the meat probe?","text":"<p>Insert the meat probe into the plug, and short press setup button“SET” to set the target temperature. <br\/>1. After the first press, the temperature icon for P1 will be flashing.<br\/>2. After the second press, the temperature icon for P2 . <br\/>3. Increase or decrease the target temperature by pressing \"P2\"or“＋” button: each short press adds or deducts 1.8°F, while long press“-” to increase or decrease the target temperature continuously. The temperature range of meat probe is 104°F-212°F. <br\/>4. The thrid press will confirm all the setup. • There will be a beep when the meat temperature is reached to the target  temperature.<\/p>","read_number":0}}},"block_order":["question_YcnprG","question_mqHWNF","question_UYYaqd","question_HdTpHB","question_PbBJKM","question_JDEbNU","question_mYRfhC","question_bj67kc","question_XKqxxp","question_bYwRzR","question_hwWpxE","question_iPxiX4","question_T9LVCm","question_YAkVA6","question_Y6AfEV","question_CEJjRG","question_kygPaj","question_99p6QB","question_XGTQPK","question_4DQPXc","question_rUrRGG"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"heading":"FAQs on 4 Main Burners","heading_align":"text-center","color_scheme":"none","full_width":true}},"1709289004018c5015":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"yotpo_product_reviews_ugc_reviews_xNyrHA":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\